grate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{10}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{3}{10}\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{10}\\left(\\ln\\left|3 \\cos^{2}{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 3\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "3f2d23a6-bc05-5891-a41a-a0ec9b709b67" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "3f2d23a6-bc05-5891-a41a-a0ec9b709b67" :question/answer-fields "a907b5be-b375-5822-96b0-7411cf15610d"] [:db/ensure "3f2d23a6-bc05-5891-a41a-a0ec9b709b67" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "3f2d23a6-bc05-5891-a41a-a0ec9b709b67"] [:db/add "06cf4afd-d7f8-51b6-91c4-df6686bb24bb" :answer/id #uuid "06cf4afd-d7f8-51b6-91c4-df6686bb24bb"] [:db/add "06cf4afd-d7f8-51b6-91c4-df6686bb24bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "06cf4afd-d7f8-51b6-91c4-df6686bb24bb" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\ln\\left|3 \\tan^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2\\right|\\right)"] [:db/ensure "06cf4afd-d7f8-51b6-91c4-df6686bb24bb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ee098494-f33c-59b7-b94e-0fafab3d0352" :answer-field/id #uuid "ee098494-f33c-59b7-b94e-0fafab3d0352"] [:db/add "ee098494-f33c-59b7-b94e-0fafab3d0352" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "ee098494-f33c-59b7-b94e-0fafab3d0352" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ee098494-f33c-59b7-b94e-0fafab3d0352" :answer-field/choices "06cf4afd-d7f8-51b6-91c4-df6686bb24bb"] [:db/add "ee098494-f33c-59b7-b94e-0fafab3d0352" :answer-field/correct "06cf4afd-d7f8-51b6-91c4-df6686bb24bb"] [:db/ensure "ee098494-f33c-59b7-b94e-0fafab3d0352" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "80742553-f898-5e65-bfb0-514b09ac805c" :question/id #uuid "80742553-f898-5e65-bfb0-514b09ac805c"] [:db/add "80742553-f898-5e65-bfb0-514b09ac805c" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{- 6 \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3 \\tan^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "80742553-f898-5e65-bfb0-514b09ac805c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 \\tan^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=24 \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{- 6 \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3 \\tan^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\ln\\left|3 \\tan^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "80742553-f898-5e65-bfb0-514b09ac805c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "80742553-f898-5e65-bfb0-514b09ac805c" :question/answer-fields "ee098494-f33c-59b7-b94e-0fafab3d0352"] [:db/ensure "80742553-f898-5e65-bfb0-514b09ac805c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "80742553-f898-5e65-bfb0-514b09ac805c"] [:db/add "b5f95172-21b8-5321-9277-26491c7d5476" :answer/id #uuid "b5f95172-21b8-5321-9277-26491c7d5476"] [:db/add "b5f95172-21b8-5321-9277-26491c7d5476" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b5f95172-21b8-5321-9277-26491c7d5476" :answer/value "- \\frac{7}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|\\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 4\\right|\\right)"] [:db/ensure "b5f95172-21b8-5321-9277-26491c7d5476" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dfc81122-c29c-505e-b9f1-0c7b7aaa7f80" :answer-field/id #uuid "dfc81122-c29c-505e-b9f1-0c7b7aaa7f80"] [:db/add "dfc81122-c29c-505e-b9f1-0c7b7aaa7f80" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "dfc81122-c29c-505e-b9f1-0c7b7aaa7f80" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "dfc81122-c29c-505e-b9f1-0c7b7aaa7f80" :answer-field/choices "b5f95172-21b8-5321-9277-26491c7d5476"] [:db/add "dfc81122-c29c-505e-b9f1-0c7b7aaa7f80" :answer-field/correct "b5f95172-21b8-5321-9277-26491c7d5476"] [:db/ensure "dfc81122-c29c-505e-b9f1-0c7b7aaa7f80" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1d16dcd1-db05-5c2e-982a-f9fdb9432f85" :question/id #uuid "1d16dcd1-db05-5c2e-982a-f9fdb9432f85"] [:db/add "1d16dcd1-db05-5c2e-982a-f9fdb9432f85" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{7 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{\\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "1d16dcd1-db05-5c2e-982a-f9fdb9432f85" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 4$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- 2 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{7 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{\\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{7}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{7}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|\\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 4\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "1d16dcd1-db05-5c2e-982a-f9fdb9432f85" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "1d16dcd1-db05-5c2e-982a-f9fdb9432f85" :question/answer-fields "dfc81122-c29c-505e-b9f1-0c7b7aaa7f80"] [:db/ensure "1d16dcd1-db05-5c2e-982a-f9fdb9432f85" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "1d16dcd1-db05-5c2e-982a-f9fdb9432f85"] [:db/add "8a89fb17-7727-5d3f-bb4c-9699e30d529d" :answer/id #uuid "8a89fb17-7727-5d3f-bb4c-9699e30d529d"] [:db/add "8a89fb17-7727-5d3f-bb4c-9699e30d529d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8a89fb17-7727-5d3f-bb4c-9699e30d529d" :answer/value "- \\frac{7}{10}\\left(\\ln\\left|2 \\sec{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5\\right|\\right)"] [:db/ensure "8a89fb17-7727-5d3f-bb4c-9699e30d529d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f9366ac6-a00f-592f-9b86-7a32fb585c4a" :answer-field/id #uuid "f9366ac6-a00f-592f-9b86-7a32fb585c4a"] [:db/add "f9366ac6-a00f-592f-9b86-7a32fb585c4a" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "f9366ac6-a00f-592f-9b86-7a32fb585c4a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f9366ac6-a00f-592f-9b86-7a32fb585c4a" :answer-field/choices "8a89fb17-7727-5d3f-bb4c-9699e30d529d"] [:db/add "f9366ac6-a00f-592f-9b86-7a32fb585c4a" :answer-field/correct "8a89fb17-7727-5d3f-bb4c-9699e30d529d"] [:db/ensure "f9366ac6-a00f-592f-9b86-7a32fb585c4a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6864c6d3-f922-56eb-9ad3-b877d706345d" :question/id #uuid "6864c6d3-f922-56eb-9ad3-b877d706345d"] [:db/add "6864c6d3-f922-56eb-9ad3-b877d706345d" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{- 7 \\tan{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{2 \\sec{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "6864c6d3-f922-56eb-9ad3-b877d706345d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 \\sec{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=10 \\tan{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(5 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{- 7 \\tan{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{2 \\sec{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{7}{10}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{10}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{7}{10}\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{10}\\left(\\ln\\left|2 \\sec{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "6864c6d3-f922-56eb-9ad3-b877d706345d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "6864c6d3-f922-56eb-9ad3-b877d706345d" :question/answer-fields "f9366ac6-a00f-592f-9b86-7a32fb585c4a"] [:db/ensure "6864c6d3-f922-56eb-9ad3-b877d706345d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "6864c6d3-f922-56eb-9ad3-b877d706345d"] [:db/add "3c831a5f-58a0-5dce-a633-b588a9bbfa48" :answer/id #uuid "3c831a5f-58a0-5dce-a633-b588a9bbfa48"] [:db/add "3c831a5f-58a0-5dce-a633-b588a9bbfa48" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3c831a5f-58a0-5dce-a633-b588a9bbfa48" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{13}{9}\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "3c831a5f-58a0-5dce-a633-b588a9bbfa48" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6ad6f867-c4de-57ca-867b-905db4c575e7" :answer-field/id #uuid "6ad6f867-c4de-57ca-867b-905db4c575e7"] [:db/add "6ad6f867-c4de-57ca-867b-905db4c575e7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "6ad6f867-c4de-57ca-867b-905db4c575e7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "6ad6f867-c4de-57ca-867b-905db4c575e7" :answer-field/choices "3c831a5f-58a0-5dce-a633-b588a9bbfa48"] [:db/add "6ad6f867-c4de-57ca-867b-905db4c575e7" :answer-field/correct "3c831a5f-58a0-5dce-a633-b588a9bbfa48"] [:db/ensure "6ad6f867-c4de-57ca-867b-905db4c575e7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "afc505b2-eb23-556b-b4bb-186a13d68208" :question/id #uuid "afc505b2-eb23-556b-b4bb-186a13d68208"] [:db/add "afc505b2-eb23-556b-b4bb-186a13d68208" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{24}} \\frac{- 4 \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4 \\tan^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "afc505b2-eb23-556b-b4bb-186a13d68208" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 \\tan^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=32 \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=3\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{24}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{13}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{24}} \\frac{- 4 \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4 \\tan^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\int_{3}^{\\frac{13}{3}} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth new bounds are positive, so absolute values may be omitted. Evaluate:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\left[\\ln u\\right]_{3}^{\\frac{13}{3}}\\right)=- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{13}{3}\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nUsing $\\ln A-\\ln B=\\ln(A/B)$ gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{13}{9}\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "afc505b2-eb23-556b-b4bb-186a13d68208" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "afc505b2-eb23-556b-b4bb-186a13d68208" :question/answer-fields "6ad6f867-c4de-57ca-867b-905db4c575e7"] [:db/ensure "afc505b2-eb23-556b-b4bb-186a13d68208" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "afc505b2-eb23-556b-b4bb-186a13d68208"] [:db/add "a94eddf6-1425-58d6-a235-ddad7d086b2c" :answer/id #uuid "a94eddf6-1425-58d6-a235-ddad7d086b2c"] [:db/add "a94eddf6-1425-58d6-a235-ddad7d086b2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a94eddf6-1425-58d6-a235-ddad7d086b2c" :answer/value "- \\frac{7}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{11}{3 + 4 \\sqrt{2}}\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "a94eddf6-1425-58d6-a235-ddad7d086b2c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "900ffda1-c3be-5455-8830-200e5e62cdd6" :answer-field/id #uuid "900ffda1-c3be-5455-8830-200e5e62cdd6"] [:db/add "900ffda1-c3be-5455-8830-200e5e62cdd6" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "900ffda1-c3be-5455-8830-200e5e62cdd6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "900ffda1-c3be-5455-8830-200e5e62cdd6" :answer-field/choices "a94eddf6-1425-58d6-a235-ddad7d086b2c"] [:db/add "900ffda1-c3be-5455-8830-200e5e62cdd6" :answer-field/correct "a94eddf6-1425-58d6-a235-ddad7d086b2c"] [:db/ensure "900ffda1-c3be-5455-8830-200e5e62cdd6" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "046e63fb-5a4e-50f5-a8d9-2f71bedde598" :question/id #uuid "046e63fb-5a4e-50f5-a8d9-2f71bedde598"] [:db/add "046e63fb-5a4e-50f5-a8d9-2f71bedde598" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\frac{- 7 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4 \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "046e63fb-5a4e-50f5-a8d9-2f71bedde598" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=8 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=3 + 4 \\sqrt{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\frac{- 7 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4 \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{7}{8}\\left(\\int_{3 + 4 \\sqrt{2}}^{11} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth new bounds are positive, so absolute values may be omitted. Evaluate:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{8}\\left(\\left[\\ln u\\right]_{3 + 4 \\sqrt{2}}^{11}\\right)=- \\frac{7}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(11\\right)-\\ln\\left(3 + 4 \\sqrt{2}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nUsing $\\ln A-\\ln B=\\ln(A/B)$ gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{11}{3 + 4 \\sqrt{2}}\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "046e63fb-5a4e-50f5-a8d9-2f71bedde598" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "046e63fb-5a4e-50f5-a8d9-2f71bedde598" :question/answer-fields "900ffda1-c3be-5455-8830-200e5e62cdd6"] [:db/ensure "046e63fb-5a4e-50f5-a8d9-2f71bedde598" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "046e63fb-5a4e-50f5-a8d9-2f71bedde598"] [:db/add "1fd79a3a-dabb-5107-8381-850631f7217c" :answer/id #uuid "1fd79a3a-dabb-5107-8381-850631f7217c"] [:db/add "1fd79a3a-dabb-5107-8381-850631f7217c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1fd79a3a-dabb-5107-8381-850631f7217c" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{9}{5}\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "1fd79a3a-dabb-5107-8381-850631f7217c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1e9873d4-75e4-5c47-9787-4995cb8c94fb" :answer-field/id #uuid "1e9873d4-75e4-5c47-9787-4995cb8c94fb"] [:db/add "1e9873d4-75e4-5c47-9787-4995cb8c94fb" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "1e9873d4-75e4-5c47-9787-4995cb8c94fb" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1e9873d4-75e4-5c47-9787-4995cb8c94fb" :answer-field/choices "1fd79a3a-dabb-5107-8381-850631f7217c"] [:db/add "1e9873d4-75e4-5c47-9787-4995cb8c94fb" :answer-field/correct "1fd79a3a-dabb-5107-8381-850631f7217c"] [:db/ensure "1e9873d4-75e4-5c47-9787-4995cb8c94fb" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1892def1-facb-5b2a-adbe-376640d37b4e" :question/id #uuid "1892def1-facb-5b2a-adbe-376640d37b4e"] [:db/add "1892def1-facb-5b2a-adbe-376640d37b4e" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{10}} \\frac{- 5 \\sin{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{4 \\sin^{2}{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "1892def1-facb-5b2a-adbe-376640d37b4e" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 \\sin^{2}{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=40 \\sin{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(5 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=5\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{10}&\\Longrightarrow u=9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{10}} \\frac{- 5 \\sin{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{4 \\sin^{2}{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\int_{5}^{9} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth new bounds are positive, so absolute values may be omitted. Evaluate:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\left[\\ln u\\right]_{5}^{9}\\right)=- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(9\\right)-\\ln\\left(5\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nUsing $\\ln A-\\ln B=\\ln(A/B)$ gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{9}{5}\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "1892def1-facb-5b2a-adbe-376640d37b4e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1892def1-facb-5b2a-adbe-376640d37b4e" :question/answer-fields "1e9873d4-75e4-5c47-9787-4995cb8c94fb"] [:db/ensure "1892def1-facb-5b2a-adbe-376640d37b4e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "1892def1-facb-5b2a-adbe-376640d37b4e"] [:db/add "ee1ea4d1-ebd2-5960-99c5-42e133a1f2d0" :answer/id #uuid "ee1ea4d1-ebd2-5960-99c5-42e133a1f2d0"] [:db/add "ee1ea4d1-ebd2-5960-99c5-42e133a1f2d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ee1ea4d1-ebd2-5960-99c5-42e133a1f2d0" :answer/value "- \\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{6}{7}\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "ee1ea4d1-ebd2-5960-99c5-42e133a1f2d0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c28a2fd8-bb61-5eb7-b6e4-f05bd195b60e" :answer-field/id #uuid "c28a2fd8-bb61-5eb7-b6e4-f05bd195b60e"] [:db/add "c28a2fd8-bb61-5eb7-b6e4-f05bd195b60e" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c28a2fd8-bb61-5eb7-b6e4-f05bd195b60e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c28a2fd8-bb61-5eb7-b6e4-f05bd195b60e" :answer-field/choices "ee1ea4d1-ebd2-5960-99c5-42e133a1f2d0"] [:db/add "c28a2fd8-bb61-5eb7-b6e4-f05bd195b60e" :answer-field/correct "ee1ea4d1-ebd2-5960-99c5-42e133a1f2d0"] [:db/ensure "c28a2fd8-bb61-5eb7-b6e4-f05bd195b60e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ef1173f3-df57-500d-84bc-a6ebe384b05c" :question/id #uuid "ef1173f3-df57-500d-84bc-a6ebe384b05c"] [:db/add "ef1173f3-df57-500d-84bc-a6ebe384b05c" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{30}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{10}} \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{\\csc{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "ef1173f3-df57-500d-84bc-a6ebe384b05c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\csc{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- 5 \\cot{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(5 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{30}&\\Longrightarrow u=7\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{10}&\\Longrightarrow u=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{30}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{10}} \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{\\csc{\\left(5 x \\right)} + 5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int_{7}^{6} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth new bounds are positive, so absolute values may be omitted. Evaluate:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\left[\\ln u\\right]_{7}^{6}\\right)=- \\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\ln\\left(6\\right)-\\ln\\left(7\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nUsing $\\ln A-\\ln B=\\ln(A/B)$ gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{6}{7}\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "ef1173f3-df57-500d-84bc-a6ebe384b05c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "ef1173f3-df57-500d-84bc-a6ebe384b05c" :question/answer-fields "c28a2fd8-bb61-5eb7-b6e4-f05bd195b60e"] [:db/ensure "ef1173f3-df57-500d-84bc-a6ebe384b05c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "ef1173f3-df57-500d-84bc-a6ebe384b05c"] [:db/add "4ed2e109-2fdc-545a-92d0-cde0858b7f62" :answer/id #uuid "4ed2e109-2fdc-545a-92d0-cde0858b7f62"] [:db/add "4ed2e109-2fdc-545a-92d0-cde0858b7f62" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4ed2e109-2fdc-545a-92d0-cde0858b7f62" :answer/value "- \\frac{7}{36}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{5}{8}\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "4ed2e109-2fdc-545a-92d0-cde0858b7f62" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4278d7ed-fc23-59ba-9e70-1886365f8541" :answer-field/id #uuid "4278d7ed-fc23-59ba-9e70-1886365f8541"] [:db/add "4278d7ed-fc23-59ba-9e70-1886365f8541" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "4278d7ed-fc23-59ba-9e70-1886365f8541" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "4278d7ed-fc23-59ba-9e70-1886365f8541" :answer-field/choices "4ed2e109-2fdc-545a-92d0-cde0858b7f62"] [:db/add "4278d7ed-fc23-59ba-9e70-1886365f8541" :answer-field/correct "4ed2e109-2fdc-545a-92d0-cde0858b7f62"] [:db/ensure "4278d7ed-fc23-59ba-9e70-1886365f8541" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e036cff3-c45f-5085-9516-dfa7e50ba67f" :question/id #uuid "e036cff3-c45f-5085-9516-dfa7e50ba67f"] [:db/add "e036cff3-c45f-5085-9516-dfa7e50ba67f" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} \\frac{7 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3 \\cos^{3}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "e036cff3-c45f-5085-9516-dfa7e50ba67f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 \\cos^{3}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 5$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- 36 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=8\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} \\frac{7 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3 \\cos^{3}{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{7}{36}\\left(\\int_{8}^{5} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth new bounds are positive, so absolute values may be omitted. Evaluate:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{36}\\left(\\left[\\ln u\\right]_{8}^{5}\\right)=- \\frac{7}{36}\\left(\\ln\\left(5\\right)-\\ln\\left(8\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nUsing $\\ln A-\\ln B=\\ln(A/B)$ gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{36}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{5}{8}\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "e036cff3-c45f-5085-9516-dfa7e50ba67f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e036cff3-c45f-5085-9516-dfa7e50ba67f" :question/answer-fields "4278d7ed-fc23-59ba-9e70-1886365f8541"] [:db/ensure "e036cff3-c45f-5085-9516-dfa7e50ba67f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "e036cff3-c45f-5085-9516-dfa7e50ba67f"] [:db/add "7eefa18c-1953-51cb-bd13-36a64b329850" :answer/id #uuid "7eefa18c-1953-51cb-bd13-36a64b329850"] [:db/add "7eefa18c-1953-51cb-bd13-36a64b329850" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7eefa18c-1953-51cb-bd13-36a64b329850" :answer/value "- \\frac{3}{16}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "7eefa18c-1953-51cb-bd13-36a64b329850" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b0f62e20-9626-5c5d-8afe-b26bc1a6ab7c" :answer-field/id #uuid "b0f62e20-9626-5c5d-8afe-b26bc1a6ab7c"] [:db/add "b0f62e20-9626-5c5d-8afe-b26bc1a6ab7c" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "b0f62e20-9626-5c5d-8afe-b26bc1a6ab7c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "b0f62e20-9626-5c5d-8afe-b26bc1a6ab7c" :answer-field/choices "7eefa18c-1953-51cb-bd13-36a64b329850"] [:db/add "b0f62e20-9626-5c5d-8afe-b26bc1a6ab7c" :answer-field/correct "7eefa18c-1953-51cb-bd13-36a64b329850"] [:db/ensure "b0f62e20-9626-5c5d-8afe-b26bc1a6ab7c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e43e7b17-97a3-5745-a8dc-5da2f3be6e02" :question/id #uuid "e43e7b17-97a3-5745-a8dc-5da2f3be6e02"] [:db/add "e43e7b17-97a3-5745-a8dc-5da2f3be6e02" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4 \\cot^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "e43e7b17-97a3-5745-a8dc-5da2f3be6e02" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 \\cot^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 4$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- 16 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=8\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4 \\cot^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{3}{16}\\left(\\int_{8}^{4} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth new bounds are positive, so absolute values may be omitted. Evaluate:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{16}\\left(\\left[\\ln u\\right]_{8}^{4}\\right)=- \\frac{3}{16}\\left(\\ln\\left(4\\right)-\\ln\\left(8\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nUsing $\\ln A-\\ln B=\\ln(A/B)$ gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{16}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "e43e7b17-97a3-5745-a8dc-5da2f3be6e02" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e43e7b17-97a3-5745-a8dc-5da2f3be6e02" :question/answer-fields "b0f62e20-9626-5c5d-8afe-b26bc1a6ab7c"] [:db/ensure "e43e7b17-97a3-5745-a8dc-5da2f3be6e02" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "e43e7b17-97a3-5745-a8dc-5da2f3be6e02"] [:db/add "fa860e43-7ad5-5b4b-bc93-ba4ab7a582d8" :answer/id #uuid "fa860e43-7ad5-5b4b-bc93-ba4ab7a582d8"] [:db/add "fa860e43-7ad5-5b4b-bc93-ba4ab7a582d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fa860e43-7ad5-5b4b-bc93-ba4ab7a582d8" :answer/value "- \\frac{3}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{5}{3}\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "fa860e43-7ad5-5b4b-bc93-ba4ab7a582d8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0ad22e38-745f-532b-9c6f-88d37bae9b52" :answer-field/id #uuid "0ad22e38-745f-532b-9c6f-88d37bae9b52"] [:db/add "0ad22e38-745f-532b-9c6f-88d37bae9b52" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "0ad22e38-745f-532b-9c6f-88d37bae9b52" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0ad22e38-745f-532b-9c6f-88d37bae9b52" :answer-field/choices "fa860e43-7ad5-5b4b-bc93-ba4ab7a582d8"] [:db/add "0ad22e38-745f-532b-9c6f-88d37bae9b52" :answer-field/correct "fa860e43-7ad5-5b4b-bc93-ba4ab7a582d8"] [:db/ensure "0ad22e38-745f-532b-9c6f-88d37bae9b52" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b4a85ff2-6d2d-574f-934b-31afc699e06c" :question/id #uuid "b4a85ff2-6d2d-574f-934b-31afc699e06c"] [:db/add "b4a85ff2-6d2d-574f-934b-31afc699e06c" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{4}} \\frac{- 6 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)}}{2 \\tan{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "b4a85ff2-6d2d-574f-934b-31afc699e06c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 \\tan{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)} + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=16 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=3\\\\x=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{4}} \\frac{- 6 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)}}{2 \\tan{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{3}{8}\\left(\\int_{3}^{5} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBoth new bounds are positive, so absolute values may be omitted. Evaluate:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{8}\\left(\\left[\\ln u\\right]_{3}^{5}\\right)=- \\frac{3}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(5\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nUsing $\\ln A-\\ln B=\\ln(A/B)$ gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{8}\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{5}{3}\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "b4a85ff2-6d2d-574f-934b-31afc699e06c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b4a85ff2-6d2d-574f-934b-31afc699e06c" :question/answer-fields "0ad22e38-745f-532b-9c6f-88d37bae9b52"] [:db/ensure "b4a85ff2-6d2d-574f-934b-31afc699e06c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "b4a85ff2-6d2d-574f-934b-31afc699e06c"] [:db/add "eaafea93-dc58-5ce7-8cdf-fd742c465cc8" :answer/id #uuid "eaafea93-dc58-5ce7-8cdf-fd742c465cc8"] [:db/add "eaafea93-dc58-5ce7-8cdf-fd742c465cc8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "eaafea93-dc58-5ce7-8cdf-fd742c465cc8" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2-2\\left(\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2\\right|\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "eaafea93-dc58-5ce7-8cdf-fd742c465cc8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "aab7748b-d307-575f-a1ca-60b716c8fe2e" :answer-field/id #uuid "aab7748b-d307-575f-a1ca-60b716c8fe2e"] [:db/add "aab7748b-d307-575f-a1ca-60b716c8fe2e" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "aab7748b-d307-575f-a1ca-60b716c8fe2e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "aab7748b-d307-575f-a1ca-60b716c8fe2e" :answer-field/choices "eaafea93-dc58-5ce7-8cdf-fd742c465cc8"] [:db/add "aab7748b-d307-575f-a1ca-60b716c8fe2e" :answer-field/correct "eaafea93-dc58-5ce7-8cdf-fd742c465cc8"] [:db/ensure "aab7748b-d307-575f-a1ca-60b716c8fe2e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "31af3e89-444a-5351-ab86-623f9917660d" :question/id #uuid "31af3e89-444a-5351-ab86-623f9917660d"] [:db/add "31af3e89-444a-5351-ab86-623f9917660d" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{- \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "31af3e89-444a-5351-ab86-623f9917660d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4 \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nSince $\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)}=u-2$, the remaining quotient is\n\n$$\n\\frac{u-2}{u}=1-\\frac{2}{u}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{- \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int 1 - \\frac{2}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int 1 - \\frac{2}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(u-2\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2-2\\left(\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2\\right|\\right)\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "31af3e89-444a-5351-ab86-623f9917660d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "31af3e89-444a-5351-ab86-623f9917660d" :question/answer-fields "aab7748b-d307-575f-a1ca-60b716c8fe2e"] [:db/ensure "31af3e89-444a-5351-ab86-623f9917660d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "31af3e89-444a-5351-ab86-623f9917660d"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "0410c7a8-bc55-5402-b03c-564f9f5071d7"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/4b/4b2e25b742b9774b1ca671527404155a24785563eb88306aece872c5951d48a5/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/validate] [:db/cas 17592186487529 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186487530 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186487536 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186487541 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186487549 :question/retired nil true]]
